    "user_title": "Build Claude Code Skills and Hooks",
    "value_statement": "Creating Claude Code skills requires consistent structure, triggers, hooks, agents, and commands. This skill provides a practical guide for building and managing those components.",
    "seo_keywords": [
      "Claude",
